a file nobody uses, must break, Every file is used
a file nobody uses, must explain, '"kernel/notes.plain, breaks, Every file is used", holds because, "not kernel/notes.plain, is, a used file"'

[file], breaks, Every file engine.go loads is in the folder
    if kernel/engine.go, loads, [file]
    and not [file], is, in the folder
    and not [file], is, certified

